WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:37,030
What the hell kind of place is this?

2
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:38,030
I'm your mother

3
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:39,060
You are not my mother at all

4
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:41,060
I still let you see it

5
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:43,410
How am I different?

6
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:44,410
Tell me

7
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:45,410
I'll study hard

8
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:49,460
I'll act like it next time

9
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:50,460
What kind of mother do you want?

10
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:51,520
It can all change

11
00:00:51,520 --> 00:01:03,430
Tell me quickly

12
00:01:03,430 --> 00:01:05,430
How do you get out of here?

13
00:01:05,430 --> 00:01:06,430
Isn't this good?

14
00:01:06,430 --> 00:01:07,430
why do you want to leave

15
00:01:07,430 --> 00:01:08,820
Tell me quickly

16
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:09,820
Then you have to wait

17
00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:10,820
Have to wait a long, long time

18
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:11,820
time has come

19
00:01:11,820 --> 00:01:12,820
the door will open

20
00:01:12,820 --> 00:01:13,880
How long will it take to wait?

21
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:14,880
Then watch me dance

22
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:15,880
I am happy when I dance

23
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:16,880
happy time

24
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:17,880
It passed quickly

25
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:18,880
Jump quickly

26
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:29,580
How did I get so old?

27
00:01:29,580 --> 00:01:30,580
Why have I become so old again?

28
00:01:30,580 --> 00:01:31,580
the door has been opened

29
00:01:32,580 --> 00:01:40,200
stay here

30
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,200
I can make you young again

31
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:43,260
Have you really thought about it? Get out of here?

32
00:01:44,260 --> 00:02:04,880
Changed back again

33
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:24,580
Please go out as soon as possible

34
00:02:24,580 --> 00:02:25,580
looking for clues

35
00:02:25,580 --> 00:02:31,410
Hurry up and get the clues

36
00:02:31,410 --> 00:02:32,410
Don't wait until dark this time

37
00:02:32,410 --> 00:02:39,300
Don't panic first

38
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:40,300
I just want to ask you something

39
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:42,330
don't come near me

40
00:02:42,330 --> 00:02:44,330
Let's wait until we get the clues and come back.

41
00:02:44,330 --> 00:02:45,330
Panzi, don't be nervous

42
00:02:45,330 --> 00:02:46,330
Any one of the three of us could be a wolf

43
00:02:46,330 --> 00:02:47,330
Let me just ask

44
00:02:47,330 --> 00:02:48,330
when you were a child

45
00:02:48,330 --> 00:02:50,520
Do you often go online?

46
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:53,810
I used to go online when I was a kid. Is that okay?

47
00:02:53,810 --> 00:02:54,810
Let's finish the task quickly

48
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:02,660
What's up, Brother Dao?

49
00:03:02,660 --> 00:03:04,240
In fact, Zihan

50
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,240
Got the clue from the tower yesterday

51
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,240
But I lied to you both

52
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:08,010
What clue?

53
00:03:08,010 --> 00:03:09,810
Here

54
00:03:09,810 --> 00:03:10,810
A piece of something

55
00:03:10,810 --> 00:03:11,810
Commitment letter promising not to go online

56
00:03:11,810 --> 00:03:12,810
Wolf knew how to surf the Internet when he was a child

57
00:03:12,810 --> 00:03:13,810
The promisee has been painted out

58
00:03:13,810 --> 00:03:14,810
Can't recognize

59
00:03:14,810 --> 00:03:15,810
Then what?

60
00:03:15,810 --> 00:03:16,810
I just asked Panzi

61
00:03:16,810 --> 00:03:17,810
He used to surf the Internet when he was a child

62
00:03:17,810 --> 00:03:18,810
And Panzi is quite abnormal.

63
00:03:18,810 --> 00:03:21,700
I think he is probably a wolf

64
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:22,700
This is not when I was a kid

65
00:03:22,700 --> 00:03:23,700
Did you write a letter of comment?

66
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:24,700
Why are you here?

67
00:03:24,700 --> 00:03:28,480
So you are the wolf

68
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:31,110
for you last night

69
00:03:31,110 --> 00:03:33,110
to make a choice

70
00:03:33,110 --> 00:03:35,110
The night has come early

71
00:03:35,110 --> 00:03:37,110
Please everyone return to the safe house as soon as possible

72
00:03:37,110 --> 00:03:39,110
Otherwise you will be responsible for the consequences

73
00:03:39,110 --> 00:03:52,770
Brother Dao, wait for me, please don’t

74
00:03:52,770 --> 00:03:53,770
Brother Dao, what's wrong with you, Brother Dao?

75
00:03:53,770 --> 00:03:58,860
you are a werewolf

76
00:03:58,860 --> 00:04:01,760
I'm not a werewolf

77
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:02,760
I'm lucky

78
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:03,760
Who did that?

79
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:28,310
I spoke to you before

80
00:04:28,310 --> 00:04:31,560
Too loud. Sorry.

81
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,620
forgive me

82
00:04:32,620 --> 00:04:33,620
Because Brother Liang is not here

83
00:04:33,620 --> 00:04:34,620
I just want to pretend

84
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:37,740
Look like you are very powerful

85
00:04:37,740 --> 00:04:38,740
Don't kill me, okay

86
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:58,180
would you like to stay

87
00:04:58,180 --> 00:05:07,640
You have passed my screening

88
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:09,640
would you like to stay

89
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:11,180
Who are you talking about?

90
00:05:11,180 --> 00:05:13,980
My name is Ji Yun

91
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:14,980
What the hell is this place?

92
00:05:14,980 --> 00:05:15,980
Can't you get out if you win?

93
00:05:15,980 --> 00:05:17,980
I can let you out anytime

94
00:05:17,980 --> 00:05:18,980
But you have to agree to a condition

95
00:05:18,980 --> 00:05:19,980
what do you want to do

96
00:05:19,980 --> 00:05:21,360
you win

97
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:23,360
I chose you between you and brightening

98
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,360
What does it mean

99
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,360
What about brightening?

100
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,360
Brightening is dead

101
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:28,450
what does it mean

102
00:05:28,450 --> 00:05:29,450
Don't ask yet

103
00:05:29,450 --> 00:05:31,450
Your dormitory door number has been taken away

104
00:05:31,450 --> 00:05:32,450
Go back and protect your roommate

105
00:05:32,450 --> 00:05:33,450
Can you stop pretending?

106
00:05:33,450 --> 00:05:34,450
speak clearly

107
00:05:34,450 --> 00:05:35,450
I really can't handle it

108
00:05:35,450 --> 00:05:36,450
Just absorb the energy of study

109
00:05:36,450 --> 00:05:37,450
He allows you to protect your roommate

110
00:05:37,450 --> 00:05:38,450
what energy

111
00:05:38,450 --> 00:05:51,390
The house number is really gone

112
00:05:51,390 --> 00:07:28,010
Finally landed

113
00:07:28,010 --> 00:07:30,700
what does it mean

114
00:07:30,700 --> 00:07:33,540
Have you never been to a lighthouse?

115
00:07:33,540 --> 00:07:36,660
what lighthouse are you talking about

116
00:07:37,460 --> 00:07:39,460
Didn't you exchange it?

117
00:07:39,460 --> 00:07:40,460
What exchange

118
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:41,460
What are you talking about?

119
00:07:41,460 --> 00:08:12,550
If the mouth is in front, one person is allowed to go out

120
00:08:12,550 --> 00:08:13,550
Can only go out alone
